  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Emergency Appeal 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific objective 1: Life-saving emergency Health, Protection and WASH intervention for 90,845 conflict-affected women, men, girls and boys by the Yemen war living in Aden and Al Dhale&apos;e governorates in Yemen, including IDP camps 

 

Specific objective 2: Increasing access to food and health services of most vulnerable conflict affected people contributing enhanced community resilience and a minimum household food consumption score above 42.5</narrative>
  </description>
